# Python libraries every coding run can use (documents: Word, Excel,
# PowerPoint, PDF). Exact versions; transitive pins and hashes live in
# requirements.txt. After changing a pin, regenerate it with:
#   uv pip compile runtime-adapter/toolchain/requirements.in --universal \
#     --python-version 3.11 --generate-hashes --only-binary :all: \
#     -o runtime-adapter/toolchain/requirements.txt
# then run `npm run toolchain:setup` and the adapter tests.
